        <mxCell id="usb-note" value="&lt;b&gt;USB power:&lt;/b&gt; leave J1 VBUS insulated / unconnected. Power the board from its existing supply; share GND.&lt;br&gt;Place series resistors close to the chip. Reserve unpopulated shunt-capacitor footprints there and low-capacitance USB ESD protection at J1.&lt;br&gt;Route D-/D+ together, short and length-matched, over continuous GND; target 90 Ω differential impedance. No external D+ pull-up needed." style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="335" width="710" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
