        <mxCell id="strap-note" value="GPIO46: keep LOW for download (internal pull-down; no external high drive).&lt;br&gt;GPIO45: keep LOW/default for 3.3 V flash unless the selected chip/memory requires otherwise.&lt;br&gt;GPIO3: keep unloaded until JTAG/strap configuration is confirmed." style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
