        <mxCell id="boot-seq" value="&lt;b&gt;Firmware recovery:&lt;/b&gt; hold BOOT, press and release RESET, wait at least 3 ms, then release BOOT and upload over native USB.&lt;br&gt;RESET pulls EN low; it is not a GPIO button. Do not add a large capacitor on GPIO0. Tune EN RC if startup/switchover testing shows unreliable resets." style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
